  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: \\(\\frac{d y}{d x}=\\frac{y}{x}+\\tan \\frac{y}{x}\\)\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { Put } \\frac{y}{x}=\\theta, y=\\theta x \\\\\n& \\frac{d y}{d x}=\\theta+\\frac{x d \\theta}{d x} \\\\\n& \\theta+x \\cdot \\frac{d \\theta}{d x}=\\theta+\\tan \\theta, \\frac{d \\theta}{\\tan \\theta}=\\frac{d y}{x}\n\\end{aligned}\\)\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\int \\cot \\theta d \\theta=\\int \\frac{d x}{x} \\\\\n& \\log \\sin \\theta=\\log x+\\log c \\\\\n& \\sin \\theta=x . c ., \\sin \\frac{y}{x}=x . c \\\\\n& x=c \\cdot \\sin \\frac{y}{x}\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
    "image": null
  },
